+
+The full doubly-small manifold-homeomorphism question remains **unsolved in this attempt**. [PARTIAL.md](PARTIAL.md) supplies an explicit affirmative proof for dimensions one and two, including the boundary-fixed interval and closed disk, using credited established planar theorems. No novelty is claimed. The higher-dimensional and stronger smooth-recurrence questions remain outside the proved scope.
